From dd6a10d43a2ab95cda61bc2ecee9d6e32c4183dd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Abhishek Kunati <itsmekunati@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 20:20:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/8] octet: rename binaries, conf file, data dir, user agent
 and default ports

Binaries are renamed via OUTPUT_NAME only (octetd, octet-cli, octet-qt); CMake
target names are unchanged so the functional test framework keeps working.
Default ports: p2p/rpc main 25333/25332, testnet 25433/25432, testnet4
25533/25532, signet 25633/25632, regtest 25744/25743. All below the Linux
ephemeral range (32768+).
---
 CMakeLists.txt             |  2 +-
 src/CMakeLists.txt         |  2 ++
 src/bitcoin-cli.cpp        |  2 +-
 src/chainparamsbase.cpp    | 10 +++++-----
 src/clientversion.cpp      |  2 +-
 src/common/args.cpp        | 18 +++++++++---------
 src/kernel/chainparams.cpp | 10 +++++-----
 src/qt/CMakeLists.txt      |  1 +
 src/rpc/util.cpp           |  4 ++--
 9 files changed, 27 insertions(+), 24 deletions(-)

